# docs/ is local-only, whole. It began as a place for our own screenshots and grew into the
# working desk: the plans, the handoffs, the audits, the request queue. Enumerating the
# internal names was the old rule, and it worked right up until a file arrived that no glob
# had been written for yet — so the directory is ignored entirely rather than file by file.
# Anything meant for a reader goes in README.md, the wiki, or assets/screenshots/.
docs/

